=2 Walkthrough
* Head for {z:Norg} and speak to {p:Gilgamesh} by clicking on the Oaken Door at (K-8).
* Head back to {z:Ru'Aun Gardens} and go to any entrance to {z:the Shrine of Ru'Avitau|The Shrine of Ru'Avitau}. Enter for a cutscene. Teleporting to the home point will also trigger the cutscene.
** You may find entering the shrine from (I-6) (near {z:Ru'Aun Gardens} Home Point #1) to save time approaching the next quest.

